  DisplayName: Runner
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You served as a messenger for a specific faction, guild, house, or
    individual, often running those messages on a short timeline. Finding the quickest
    path from point A to point B is your specialty and you've learned to make the
    most of your athleticism and navigational skill. Choose two attribute boosts.
    One must be to Strength or Intelligence , and one is a free attribute boost.
    You are trained in the Athletics skill and a Lore skill for the city in which
    you were a messenger. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Quick
    Jump] skill feat.
